                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300">You are wrong about this figure.</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300 text-center">( &nbsp;&nbsp; )</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300">B. I’m afraid I won’t be able to attend due to a prior commitment.</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300 text-center">3</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300">I can't come to the meeting.</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300 text-center">( &nbsp;&nbsp; )</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300">C. I would appreciate it if you could send the report by 5 PM.</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300 text-center">4</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300">I don't understand what you mean.</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300 text-center">( &nbsp;&nbsp; )</td>
                                    <td class="p-2 border border-slate-300">D. I have a slightly different understanding regarding this number.</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                `;
            }

            if (secJargon) {
                html += `
                    <div class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 bg-slate-100 p-2 border-l-4 border-slate-800">
                            🧩 第二部分：職場必備 Jargon 術語解密 — 20%
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-2">備選單字庫 (Word Bank): <strong>A. Touch base &nbsp;&nbsp; B. Ballpark figure &nbsp;&nbsp; C. Circle back &nbsp;&nbsp; D. Win-win situation</strong></p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-800">
                            <p>1. ( &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ) A rough estimate or approximate cost of something. *(對費用之粗略估算)*</p>
                            <p>2. ( &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ) To brief each other or check in briefly on a project's progress. *(短暫聯繫進度)*</p>
                            <p>3. ( &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ) An outcome or deal that benefits all parties involved. *(雙贏協議)*</p>
                            <p>4. ( &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ) To return to an issue or topic at a later time. *(稍後再回頭討論)*</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                `;
            }

            if (secDetective) {
                html += `
                    <div class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 bg-slate-100 p-2 border-l-4 border-slate-800">
                            🕵️ 第三部分：商務郵件除錯偵探 (Email Detective) — 30%
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-2">請圈出 Email 中 5 個文法或用語錯誤，並寫出修正內容：</p>
                        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded font-mono text-xs mb-3 space-y-1">
                            <p>Subject: Re: Next week meeting confirmation</p>
                            <p>Dear Mr. Smith,</p>
                            <p>Thank you for your email. I am write to confirm our meeting on next Monday at 10:00 AM.</p>
                            <p>We are looking forward to discuss the project details with you.</p>
                            <p>Please find attached the updated agenda for your review. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to call me.</p>
                            <p>Best regards,<br>Alex Chen</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xs space-y-2">
                            <p>1. __________________________________________________________________________</p>
                            <p>2. __________________________________________________________________________</p>
                            <p>3. __________________________________________________________________________</p>
                            <p>4. __________________________________________________________________________</p>
                            <p>5. __________________________________________________________________________</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                `;
            }

            if (secScenario) {
                html += `
                    <div class="mb-8">
                        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 bg-slate-100 p-2 border-l-4 border-slate-800">
                            🎭 第四部分：會議談判情境抉擇 — 30%
                        </h2>
                        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                            <div>
                                <p class="font-bold">1. 線上會議對方音訊卡頓聽不清楚時，該如何委婉提醒？</p>
                                <p class="ml-2">[ ] A. "Your microphone is terrible, fix it."</p>
                                <p class="ml-2">[ ] B. "You are breaking up a bit. Could you please repeat that last point?"</p>
                                <p class="ml-2">[ ] C. "Stop talking, I can't hear anything."</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="font-bold">2. 當客戶要求不可能完成的交期 (Deadline) 時，最專業的回應是？</p>
                                <p class="ml-2">[ ] A. "No way, that is completely impossible."</p>
                                <p class="ml-2">[ ] B. "Given our current scope, that timeline would be challenging. However, we could deliver Phase 1 first."</p>
                                <p class="ml-2">[ ] C. "Why do you need it so fast?"</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                `;
            }

            // Append Teacher Answer Key Page
            html += `
                <div class="page-break pt-8 border-t-2 border-dashed border-slate-400 mt-12">
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 text-center">📝 答案與解析頁 (Answer Key & Explanations)</h1>
                    <div class="text-xs space-y-4 text-slate-800">
                        <div>
                            <strong class="text-indigo-900 block mb-1">第一部分：Email 語氣大升級</strong>
                            <p>1 - C &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2 - D &nbsp;|&nbsp; 3 - B &nbsp;|&nbsp; 4 - A</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="text-indigo-900 block mb-1">第二部分：商務 Jargon 術語解密</strong>
                            <p>1. B (Ballpark figure) &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2. A (Touch base) &nbsp;|&nbsp; 3. D (Win-win situation) &nbsp;|&nbsp; 4. C (Circle back)</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="text-indigo-900 block mb-1">第三部分：商務郵件除錯偵探</strong>
                            <p>1. I am write $\\rightarrow$ <strong>I am writing</strong> (現在進行式)</p>
                            <p>2. on next Monday $\\rightarrow$ <strong>next Monday</strong> (next/last前不加on)</p>
                            <p>3. look forward to discuss $\\rightarrow$ <strong>look forward to discussing</strong> (to為介系詞加V-ing)</p>
                            <p>4. Next week meeting $\\rightarrow$ <strong>Next week's meeting</strong> (所有格更標準)</p>
                            <p>5. call me $\\rightarrow$ 可修正為 <strong>reach out to me</strong> 或 <strong>contact me</strong> (更加商務專業)</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="text-indigo-900 block mb-1">第四部分：會議談判情境抉擇</strong>
                            <p>1. B (breaking up 表示卡頓) &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2. B (提出 Phase 1 替代方案)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            `;

            document.getElementById('paper-preview-container').innerHTML = html;
            document.getElementById('printable-paper-sheet').innerHTML = html;
        }

        /* Helper Modal Function */
        function alertModal(msg) {
            const modal = document.createElement('div');
            modal.className = "fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4";
            modal.innerHTML = `
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xl max-w-sm w-full p-5 space-y-4 text-center">
                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">${escapeHtml(msg)}</p>
                    <button onclick="this.closest('.fixed').remove()" class="px-5 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-700">確定</button>
                </div>
            `;
            document.body.appendChild(modal);
        }

        function escapeHtml(str) {
            if (!str) return '';
            return str.replace(/&/g, "&amp;")
                      .replace(/</g, "&lt;")
                      .replace(/>/g, "&gt;")
                      .replace(/"/g, "&quot;")
                      .replace(/'/g, "&#039;");
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
